---
const steps = [
  {
    step: "01",
    title: "El scraping convencional falla.",
    blocks: [
      "Los buscadores de IA no pueden rastrear catálogos dinámicos mediante scraping clásico:",
      "• Captchas y pop-ups de stock bloquean los rastreadores de modelos como Claude o ChatGPT.",
      "• Los datos obsoletos hacen que los asistentes recomienden productos agotados o precios incorrectos.",
    ],
  },
  {
    step: "02",
    title: "Formato estructurado nativo.",
    blocks: [
      "Traducimos tu tienda de WooCommerce a un contrato de datos optimizado para IA (AEO):",
      "• Herramientas MCP integradas: Los agentes consultan tu catálogo mediante llamadas de función JSON estructuradas.",
      "• Cero sobrecarga visual: La IA extrae especificaciones, tallas y variantes sin procesar código HTML.",
    ],
  },
  {
    step: "03",
    strapline: "Sincronización Inteligente",
    title: "Catálogo y stock en tiempo real.",
    blocks: [
      "Tu plugin WooCommerce se conecta directamente al Bridge mediante firmas de seguridad HMAC:",
      "• Webhooks instantáneos: Cada cambio de inventario o precio se propaga automáticamente en segundos.",
      "• Smart Sync por volumen: El sistema balancea automáticamente qué productos exponer según la cuota de tu plan.",
    ],
  },
  {
    step: "04",
    strapline: "Aislamiento y Control",
    title: "Tu e-commerce 100% seguro.",
    blocks: [
      "Protegemos el acceso a tus sistemas críticos de venta mediante políticas de control estrictas:",
      "• Solo lectura: Los agentes de IA solo pueden leer los campos del catálogo autorizados, nunca modificar la base de datos.",
      "• Defensa anti-scraping: Control de paginación y rate limits distribuidos que evitan la extracción masiva de tus datos.",
    ],
  },
];
---

<section id="bridge-solution" class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.12]"
    style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 26px 26px;"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/10 px-6 py-10 lg:px-10 lg:py-12 bg-zinc-950/70">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500 mb-4">La Solución</p>
      <h2 class="text-h2 max-w-2xl text-white">
        MCP-Bridge: el enchufe universal del
        <span class="text-zinc-400"> e-commerce agéntico.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-body-lead text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl">
        No le enseñes a la IA a navegar por tu web; dale una línea directa y estructurada a tu catálogo.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 hidden lg:block">
        <div class="md:h-[600px] overflow-hidden reveal-up delay-200 bg-zinc-900/40 w-full h-[500px] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl relative shadow-2xl shadow-black/40 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="slide absolute inset-0 transition-opacity duration-700 ease-in-out opacity-100 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8" id="slide-1" style="opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto;">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-[0.03] dark:opacity-[0.05] pointer-events-none transition-opacity" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, currentColor 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px; color: inherit;"></div>

            <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-md h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-8">
              <div class="flex justify-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce" style="animation-duration: 3s;">
                  <div class="node-pulse-orb w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 to-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25" style="--node-pulse-delay: 0s;">
                    <span class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em]">IA</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="type-micro text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-zinc-400">IA 1</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce" style="animation-duration: 3.5s; animation-delay: 0.2s;">
                  <div class="node-pulse-orb w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 to-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25" style="--node-pulse-delay: 0.25s;">
                    <span class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em]">IA</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="type-micro text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-zinc-400">IA 2</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce" style="animation-duration: 3.2s; animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                  <div class="node-pulse-orb w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 to-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/25" style="--node-pulse-delay: 0.5s;">
                    <span class="text-[13px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em]">IA</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="type-micro text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-zinc-400">IA 3</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex-1 w-full relative my-4">
                <svg class="text-zinc-700 absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-full transition-colors" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                  <path d="M140,0 C140,50 220,50 220,100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="flow-line" style="animation-duration: 1.5s;"></path>
                  <path d="M220,0 C220,50 220,50 220,100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="flow-line" style="animation-duration: 1.2s;"></path>
                  <path d="M300,0 C300,50 220,50 220,100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="flow-line" style="animation-duration: 1.8s;"></path>
                </svg>

                <div class="bridge-pulse-pill absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-orange-500 text-white text-[11px] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/50 font-semibold tracking-[0.03em] whitespace-nowrap">
                  The Bridge
                </div>
                <div class="bridge-downline absolute" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative flex items-end justify-center gap-4 h-40 w-full -translate-y-10 md:-translate-y-12">
                <div class="relative w-64 h-40 group hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
                  <div class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-56 h-36 bg-zinc-800 rounded-t-xl border-t border-x border-zinc-700 overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
                    <div class="absolute top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-24 h-4 bg-zinc-900 rounded-b-lg z-20"></div>
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-zinc-900 p-4 pt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 opacity-90">
                      <div class="w-full h-24 bg-zinc-800 rounded flex items-center justify-center">
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-ping opacity-20 absolute"></div>
                        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-red-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs">
                          <iconify-icon icon="solar:cart-large-linear" class="text-[14px]"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="w-full h-2 bg-zinc-800 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
                      <div class="w-2/3 h-2 bg-zinc-800 rounded-full animate-pulse delay-100"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-64 h-3 bg-zinc-700 rounded-b-lg shadow-2xl transition-colors">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-1 bg-zinc-400/50 rounded-b-sm"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-4 w-16 h-32 bg-zinc-900 border-[3px] border-zinc-700 rounded-2xl shadow-xl overflow-hidden hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 delay-100">
                  <div class="absolute top-2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-5 h-1.5 bg-black rounded-full z-20"></div>
                  <div class="w-full h-full bg-zinc-800 p-2 pt-6 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <div class="w-full aspect-square bg-zinc-700 rounded-lg"></div>
                    <div class="w-full h-1 bg-zinc-700 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div class="w-full h-1 bg-zinc-700 rounded-full"></div>
                    <div class="mt-auto w-full h-6 bg-orange-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                      <iconify-icon icon="solar:cart-large-linear" class="text-[10px] text-white"></iconify-icon>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
              <div class="backdrop-blur-xl bg-black/55 border border-white/20 p-4 rounded-xl flex justify-between items-center shadow-lg shadow-black/35 transition-colors">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <iconify-icon icon="solar:route-linear" class="text-orange-500 text-xl"></iconify-icon>
                  <span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-100 transition-colors" data-i18n="card1_title">Mantén tu e-commerce siempre conectado</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
                    <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-green-400 opacity-75"></span>
                    <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-green-500"></span>
                  </span>
                  <span class="type-micro text-xs text-zinc-400 transition-colors">LIVE</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 z-40 flex gap-2">
            <button class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white scale-125" aria-label="Indicador 1"></button>
            <button class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-600" aria-label="Indicador 2"></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-zinc-950/70" data-single-open-accordion>
      {steps.map((step, index) => (
        <details class="group border-b border-white/10 last:border-b-0 bg-transparent transition-all duration-300" open={index === 0}>
          <summary class="list-none cursor-pointer px-6 py-8 lg:py-10 lg:px-10 flex items-start justify-between gap-4 bg-transparent hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">
            <div>
              <p class="type-micro text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-3">({step.step})</p>
              {step.strapline && (
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-zinc-500 mb-2">{step.strapline}</p>
              )}
              <h3 class="text-h3 text-zinc-100 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-white">{step.title}</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="accordion-icon text-zinc-500 text-xl leading-none mt-2.5 inline-flex items-center">
              <iconify-icon icon="solar:arrow-right-up-linear"></iconify-icon>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <div class="px-6 pb-10 lg:pb-14 lg:px-10 bg-transparent">
            <div class="space-y-5">
              {step.blocks.map((block) => {
                const isBullet = block.startsWith("•");
                const cleanBlock = isBullet ? block.substring(1).trim() : block;

                const separatorIndex = cleanBlock.indexOf(":");
                const hasLabel = separatorIndex > 0 && separatorIndex < 80;
                const label = hasLabel ? cleanBlock.slice(0, separatorIndex + 1) : "";
                const body = hasLabel ? cleanBlock.slice(separatorIndex + 1).trim() : cleanBlock;

                if (isBullet) {
                  return (
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 pl-1">
                      <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2 mt-2 flex-shrink-0">
                        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-orange-400/60 opacity-75"></span>
                        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-orange-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(249,115,22,0.5)]"></span>
                      </span>
                      <p class="text-body-lead text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl font-light">
                        {hasLabel ? (
                          <>
                            <span class="font-medium text-zinc-200">{label}</span>{" "}{body}
                          </>
                        ) : (
                          body
                        )}
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  );
                }

                return (
                  <p class="text-body-lead text-zinc-300 max-w-2xl font-light mb-4">
                    {hasLabel ? (
                      <>
                        <span class="font-medium text-zinc-100">{label}</span>{" "}{body}
                      </>
                    ) : (
                      body
                    )}
                  </p>
                );
              })}
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  const initSingleOpenAccordions = () => {
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-single-open-accordion]").forEach((accordion) => {
      if (accordion.dataset.singleOpenReady === "true") {
        return;
      }

      accordion.dataset.singleOpenReady = "true";
      const items = Array.from(accordion.querySelectorAll("details"));

      items.forEach((item) => {
        item.addEventListener("toggle", () => {
          if (!item.open) {
            return;
          }

          items.forEach((other) => {
            if (other !== item && other.open) {
              other.open = false;
            }
          });
        });
      });
    });
  };

  if (document.readyState === "loading") {
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", initSingleOpenAccordions, { once: true });
  } else {
    initSingleOpenAccordions();
  }
</script>

<style>
  details {
    transition: background-color 300ms ease;
  }

  details[open] {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
  }

  details > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  details .accordion-icon {
    transition: transform 250ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), color 250ms ease;
  }

  details[open] .accordion-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg) translate(1px, -1px);
    color: #fb923c;
  }

  .flow-line {
    stroke-dasharray: 10;
    animation: flowDash 1s linear infinite;
  }

  .node-pulse-orb {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .node-pulse-orb::before,
  .node-pulse-orb::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -3px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.65);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -1;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.9);
    animation: bridgePulseWave 2s ease-out infinite;
    animation-delay: var(--node-pulse-delay, 0s);
  }

  .node-pulse-orb::after {
    animation-delay: calc(var(--node-pulse-delay, 0s) + 1s);
  }

  .bridge-pulse-pill {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: max-content;
    min-width: 0;
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  .bridge-pulse-pill::before,
  .bridge-pulse-pill::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: -4px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.65);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: -1;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.9);
    animation: bridgePulseWave 2s ease-out infinite;
  }

  .bridge-pulse-pill::after {
    animation-delay: 1s;
  }

  .bridge-downline {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: calc(50% + 18px);
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 2px;
    height: 92px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(113, 113, 122, 0.9) 0 8px,
      transparent 8px 16px
    );
    background-size: 2px 16px;
    animation: bridgeDownFlow 1.05s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bridgePulseWave {
    0% {
      opacity: 0.75;
      transform: scale(0.92);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.45);
    }
    70% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(1.52);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px 8px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(1.62);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 115, 22, 0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes flowDash {
    to {
      stroke-dashoffset: -20;
    }
  }

  @keyframes bridgeDownFlow {
    to {
      background-position-y: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .flow-line,
    .node-pulse-orb::before,
    .node-pulse-orb::after,
    .bridge-downline,
    .bridge-pulse-pill::before,
    .bridge-pulse-pill::after {
      animation: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
